To integrate the aggregation features while maintaining the architectural separation, we will introduce an `AggregationEngine` class. The `Pipeline` class will act as the gateway for these methods, ensuring they remain accessible as part of the pipeline's core capability while keeping the `Pipeline` class itself from becoming a "God object."

