| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `ComputedFieldEngine.apply` | **Schema Loss** | Pass `record.schema` to the `Record` constructor. |
| `Pipeline._apply_computed_fields` | **Missing Error Handling** | Wrap `compute_fn` in `try/except` and raise `PipelineError`. |
